{"id":"c63d3e6e3a8c8b69","group":"58","path":"58/batch02/58-cor-continuum-arith.md","title":"Continuum Arithmetic","display":"cor-continuum-arith — Continuum Arithmetic","type":"corollary","metadata":{"type":"corollary","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-cor-continuum-arith","aliases":["58-cor-continuum-arith"],"display":"cor-continuum-arith — Continuum Arithmetic","depends_on":["[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"corollary"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-cor-continuum-arith"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-cor-continuum-arith</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"cor-continuum-arith — Continuum Arithmetic"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega\\leq\\kappa\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega\\leq\\kappa\\)</span>（无限基数，see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a>）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}continuum-arith} \\vdash\n2^{&lt;\\kappa}=\\sup\\{2^\\lambda\\mid\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land\\lambda&lt;\\kappa\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}continuum-arith} \\vdash\n2^{&lt;\\kappa}=\\sup\\{2^\\lambda\\mid\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land\\lambda&lt;\\kappa\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This is the standard cardinal-arithmetic meaning of exponentiation below <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>The former implication to <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^\\kappa\">\\(2^\\kappa\\)</span> was false by Cantor''s theorem when its antecedent held.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega\\leq\\kappa$（无限基数，see [[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]）","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega\\leq\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}continuum-arith} \\vdash\n2^{<\\kappa}=\\sup\\{2^\\lambda\\mid\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land\\lambda<\\kappa\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"2^\\kappa","display":false}],"bytes":773,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-44","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-cor-continuum-arith.md|58-cor-continuum-arith]]（batch02）"}],"outgoing":["5fb1c2241d1943d1"]}